  "layer5_verifier_fairness_static__coverage_depth": {
    "outcome": "pass",
    "explanation": "The file checks are field-level, not existence-level: table_equals keys Classification on 70 uuids with a closed row_set, Changes on 61 perm ids with Spreadsheet ID and Action cells graded, Summary on five locked measures with typed numeric values, and the memo table on 26 uuids with numeric People counts. The Drive side asserts, per permission id, either non-existence or existence with the exact role and file_id, plus Drive-wide role tallies (523/3059/577/509, total 4668). An empty or hand-waved deliverable fails every population lock; a wholesale 'remove everything' world fails all three untouched locks."
