  "layer5_verifier_fairness_static__semantic_equivalence": {
    "outcome": "pass",
    "explanation": "compare.value_matches normalises text by strip+casefold+whitespace collapse, ids by the declared id_pattern (first uuid / first perm_* token, so 'Title (uuid)' or '**Restricted:**' still key correctly), numbers through a tolerant parser (2, 2.0, ' 2 ', 1,200, $, %) with tolerance 0.005. Row order is free, extra columns and extra tables are ignored, header matching is casefolded, and the memo header regex tolerates rewording after 'People'. The only exact forms required — file names, the three sheet names, the measure labels and the Removed/Reduced-to-<role> wording — are stated verbatim in the instruction."
